{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13103","headline":"酬张二仲彝 · 皇甫冉","name":"酬张二仲彝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴洲见芳草，楚客动归心。\n屈宋乡山古，荆衡烟雨深。\n艰难十载别，羁旅四愁侵。\n澧月通沅水，湘云入桂林。\n已看生白发，当爲乏黄金。\n江海时相见，唯闻梁甫吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}